WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.730
How do I add a new item in Field Sales and set its price and unit?

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:09.897
In the sidebar, click Products. The Product management page opens with the table of your items.

3
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:15.091
Click the Add item button at the top of the page, and the Add new item window appears.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.902
Enter the item code and the item name, and add the barcode if the item has one.

5
00:00:20.833 --> 00:00:25.255
Set the main unit, such as carton or piece, then enter the main unit price.

6
00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:32.197
Finally, click the Add item button at the bottom of the window. The item is saved and appears in the products table.
